WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:04.430
You've changed, somehow.

00:06.840 --> 00:09.800
I'm happy right now,

00:09.800 --> 00:14.880
because I've finally figured out what I should do,

00:14.880 --> 00:17.470
what I can do.

00:18.150 --> 00:20.110
I've become strong!

00:21.880 --> 00:25.020
There's no way something like that
can make you strong.

00:25.020 --> 00:27.280
I'll teach you that.

00:31.290 --> 00:33.390
I look forward to our match.

00:46.640 --> 00:54.250
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:54.250 --> 00:57.420
Utatte iru

00:57.420 --> 01:05.060
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:05.060 --> 01:08.330
Shimaikonde

01:08.330 --> 01:18.910
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:18.910 --> 01:24.350
Ayumou

01:24.350 --> 01:29.750
Susumou

01:29.750 --> 01:34.590
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:34.590 --> 01:40.060
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:40.060 --> 01:45.530
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:45.530 --> 01:50.770
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:50.770 --> 01:54.800
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:56.440 --> 01:59.970
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:06.450 --> 02:10.190
Episode 30
Showdown

02:21.040 --> 02:25.310
At last, this time has come...

02:25.310 --> 02:27.100
This moment has come!

02:36.250 --> 02:40.820
Zed, I want to show you how strong I've become.

02:40.820 --> 02:44.490
So, I want you to go all-out against me too!

02:45.860 --> 02:47.900
Noah, we're counting on you!

02:47.900 --> 02:50.430
Show us the power of the Neoknights!

02:50.430 --> 02:55.600
Noah! Noah! Go get him, Noah!

03:00.810 --> 03:02.610
Here I come, Zed!

03:19.430 --> 03:23.970
If I win my next match,
I will doubtless fight one of these two.

03:23.970 --> 03:26.970
But you've got the fight against
Rahja before that,

03:26.970 --> 03:29.370
and you'll be in trouble if you let
your guard down, Helic.

03:30.100 --> 03:33.900
The insolent boy and the unsociable brat, huh?

03:34.980 --> 03:38.040
This just might get a little interesting!

03:41.720 --> 03:46.520
This is the first battle I've seen between
two key spirit wielders.

03:46.520 --> 03:49.460
There is no need for worry, Your Holiness.

03:49.460 --> 03:54.020
In the name of Absolute Law,
Noah will win without fail.

04:05.970 --> 04:07.610
What's the problem, Zed?

04:07.610 --> 04:10.080
Why won't you go all-out with me?!

04:10.080 --> 04:12.350
If you don't fight all-out,

04:12.350 --> 04:14.320
this is meaningless!

04:23.890 --> 04:28.660
Hey, Noah, you're my friend, right?

04:32.600 --> 04:36.560
Then, you got to bring me what I asked for!

04:39.540 --> 04:42.240
Why don't you say something?

04:43.280 --> 04:46.980
If you don't speak up,
it makes it look like we're bullying you!

04:47.550 --> 04:48.950
Right?

04:48.950 --> 04:50.920
Cut it out already!

04:53.120 --> 04:54.920
Who are you?

05:03.830 --> 05:04.830
We'll get you for this!

05:04.830 --> 05:06.630
We'll get you for this!

05:38.000 --> 05:43.370
What is that Zed hesitating for?

05:43.370 --> 05:46.340
When you're at a Joust,
you have to enjoy yourself!

05:46.970 --> 05:50.640
But anyway, I wonder where Roya went?

05:55.380 --> 05:57.250
What should I do?

05:57.250 --> 05:59.950
Is fighting all-out the right choice?

06:10.700 --> 06:13.500
I wonder how Zed's doing in the fight?

06:19.110 --> 06:20.730
Roya...

07:00.080 --> 07:01.710
Noah!

07:03.020 --> 07:04.810
Zed...

07:08.720 --> 07:11.230
I can't exactly say this is good.

07:11.230 --> 07:15.600
Your daily life is placing undue
strain on your body.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.370
A single day in the life of an ordinary person

07:17.370 --> 07:20.300
is the equivalent of a year or two for you.

07:21.100 --> 07:22.100
If you continue to push it,

07:22.100 --> 07:25.240
then as a physician, I will not be able to give
any guarantees as to your survival.

07:25.240 --> 07:27.340
I won't be recovering from this
illness in any event.

07:27.340 --> 07:29.140
Please let me do as I like.

07:29.710 --> 07:32.750
Rather than live a long life in a hospital bed,

07:32.750 --> 07:34.250
I'd prefer do what I please.

07:34.250 --> 07:36.480
I don't mind if my life is cut short.

07:37.420 --> 07:39.510
I want to be free.

07:43.020 --> 07:44.660
Are you okay, Noah?

07:44.660 --> 07:46.460
You're wrong!

07:47.760 --> 07:50.160
I'm not the same person I was then!

07:50.160 --> 07:52.770
Right now, I should be as strong as you...

07:52.770 --> 07:55.740
No, stronger!

07:55.740 --> 07:57.360
Noah...

08:01.610 --> 08:03.240
Sachura!

08:09.450 --> 08:11.150
Sachura?

08:12.890 --> 08:15.760
We've received notification from Neotopia

08:15.760 --> 08:20.060
that they will punish a person named
"Roya" for violating the law.

08:20.060 --> 08:23.930
But " punishment" without any prior word to us?

08:23.930 --> 08:26.600
That's just too unilateral!

08:26.600 --> 08:28.570
It's the natural measure to take.

08:28.570 --> 08:31.840
After all, there are no exceptions to Absolute Law.

08:31.840 --> 08:37.280
But to punish her without allowing her the
opportunity to defend herself or plead her case,

08:37.280 --> 08:39.250
that is not something to be condoned!

08:39.250 --> 08:42.220
We should protest emphatically.

08:43.780 --> 08:51.160
Absolutely! She was sent to the Joust
as a representative of Templar!

08:51.160 --> 08:55.750
Doesn't that status make her conduct
more of a problem?

08:57.930 --> 09:00.560
That is a valid point.

09:04.470 --> 09:07.380
The matter of greatest concern at present

09:07.380 --> 09:11.570
is the potential damage to our
alliance with Neotopia.

09:12.550 --> 09:16.580
We don't want to destroy the relationship
between our countries.

09:16.580 --> 09:19.880
Then the answer should be obvious.

09:20.920 --> 09:24.120
Small sacrifices cannot be helped.

09:33.530 --> 09:35.200
Khan!

09:35.200 --> 09:37.170
Master Sebastian...

09:37.170 --> 09:38.970
What were you talking about in there?!

09:38.970 --> 09:41.670
No one told me there was a Council meeting.

09:57.360 --> 10:01.320
Hang on, Roya, I'm on my way.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.470
Roya?

10:10.470 --> 10:12.530
Oh, hi, Sagiri!

10:13.870 --> 10:15.500
Roya!

10:18.910 --> 10:22.020
Roya, are you okay?

10:22.020 --> 10:23.580
Yup...

10:23.580 --> 10:27.150
Actually, the service here is pretty good.

10:27.150 --> 10:28.720
I'm surprised.

10:28.720 --> 10:30.220
Oh, good.

10:30.220 --> 10:33.190
Look, the cookies are yummy too.

10:34.130 --> 10:36.630
You try one, Sagiri.

10:36.630 --> 10:38.260
Okay...

10:54.920 --> 10:57.150
That spirit is amazing.

10:57.150 --> 11:00.210
I'm getting numbers like I've never seen before!

11:01.890 --> 11:07.190
Yeah, that Zed guy's spirit
would be the same way.

11:08.530 --> 11:12.060
That's how dangerous key spirits are.

11:15.740 --> 11:17.730
Damn it... Rambos!

11:35.190 --> 11:36.720
Why...

11:36.720 --> 11:40.060
Why won't you call Amir Gaul?

11:40.800 --> 11:42.660
Zed!

11:42.660 --> 11:50.970
Why won't that Zed boy use
his key spirit Amir Gaul?

11:50.970 --> 11:55.470
He has a close friendship with Noah.

11:56.440 --> 12:00.540
I imagine he has allowed himself to be
ruled by sentiment in his decision.

12:01.380 --> 12:03.580
How foolish...

12:03.580 --> 12:07.450
It is the weakness of those who do not
believe in Absolute Law.

12:08.420 --> 12:12.690
Noah's victory is all but certain.

12:22.400 --> 12:24.410
What? Roya?!

12:24.410 --> 12:25.440
Yes...

12:25.440 --> 12:30.380
Neotopia has given notice that they will punish
her in accordance with Absolute Law.

12:31.050 --> 12:33.510
And what has the Council decided?!

12:33.510 --> 12:35.850
For fear of conflict with Neotopia,

12:35.850 --> 12:39.390
they have responded that they will leave
Roya's disposal in its hands.

12:39.390 --> 12:40.650
Madness!

12:40.650 --> 12:44.190
I was ordered not to tell you
or Elder Zico of this.

12:44.190 --> 12:48.200
I imagine that was the intention of the
Council from the beginning.

12:48.200 --> 12:53.470
After all, Elder Zico, in particular,
thinks of Roya as a grandchild.

12:53.470 --> 12:56.000
They were sure he would be opposed.

12:56.000 --> 13:00.270
And when will this punishment be carried out?

13:00.270 --> 13:01.840
It's almost that time now.

13:01.840 --> 13:03.410
What?!

13:03.410 --> 13:05.210
Master Sebastian?

13:05.880 --> 13:09.880
This matter must not reach Zico's ears
under any circumstances.

13:09.880 --> 13:13.820
If he knew, there's no telling what he'd do.

13:13.820 --> 13:15.450
Yes, sir.

13:16.760 --> 13:19.730
Zed, please...

13:19.730 --> 13:22.720
You're the only one who can help us right now.

13:40.050 --> 13:41.670
Sachura!

13:46.390 --> 13:48.010
Rambos!

13:49.990 --> 13:51.620
Rapid-fire!

13:55.660 --> 13:57.290
Rambos!

14:22.790 --> 14:24.420
Rambos...

14:38.010 --> 14:41.840
Zed, I'm disappointed in you.

14:41.840 --> 14:46.400
I don't care anymore whether you use Amir Gaul.

14:48.180 --> 14:51.880
I, who am supported by Absolute Law,
have won this battle.

14:52.490 --> 14:56.490
As you are now, the only word to
describe you is " pathetic. "

14:56.490 --> 14:58.160
What?!

14:58.160 --> 15:02.200
You don't have a single thing
you could call a " belief. "

15:02.200 --> 15:04.630
No matter how strong your power may be,

15:04.630 --> 15:07.270
if you don't have a strong heart,
it means nothing.

15:07.270 --> 15:10.240
But that's got nothing to do with
Absolute Law, Noah!

15:10.240 --> 15:12.210
Absolute Law is wrong!

15:12.210 --> 15:13.910
Wrong?

15:13.910 --> 15:15.910
What makes you think you can say that,

15:15.910 --> 15:18.110
when you hardly know a thing about it?

15:18.110 --> 15:20.650
You've always been like this.

15:20.650 --> 15:23.720
You always think you're the one who's right.

15:23.720 --> 15:27.780
You were only friends with me because
you felt sorry for me.

15:28.390 --> 15:29.620
No!

15:29.620 --> 15:31.160
You just used feeling sorry for me

15:31.160 --> 15:34.400
as a means to wallow in your own
sense of superiority, am I right?

15:34.400 --> 15:36.020
No!

15:36.830 --> 15:40.430
There's something I figured out
after I came to this world.

15:41.240 --> 15:46.040
In my heart, I always hated you.

15:48.680 --> 15:52.040
That's right, I hated you.

15:56.980 --> 16:01.690
There's one last thing I have to tell you.

16:01.690 --> 16:03.860
Roya's about to be executed.

16:03.860 --> 16:04.860
What?

16:04.860 --> 16:09.300
There are no exceptions for anyone
who has violated Absolute Law!

16:17.600 --> 16:19.570
Roya's going to be executed?!

16:19.570 --> 16:21.370
Like hell!

16:23.880 --> 16:27.970
If you don't defeat me,
you can't get out of here.

16:32.120 --> 16:35.520
So, what are you going to do, Zed?

16:38.360 --> 16:41.660
If I can't save Roya unless I take you down,

16:42.560 --> 16:44.530
then I'll just take you down!

16:46.730 --> 16:48.530
Amir Gaul!

16:52.540 --> 16:54.600
Go, Sachura!

17:06.120 --> 17:07.120
What is this?

17:07.120 --> 17:09.920
The numbers have gone so
high they can't display!

18:16.660 --> 18:19.460
Oh, Roya, here...

18:19.460 --> 18:23.200
You picked it up for me!

18:23.200 --> 18:24.200
Yep!

18:24.200 --> 18:25.830
Thanks.

18:29.840 --> 18:31.710
I'm telling you, don't worry.

18:31.710 --> 18:35.110
You give it your all in the Joust.

18:35.110 --> 18:38.550
It's a shame, but I'll withdraw.

18:38.550 --> 18:43.040
But you're carrying Templar on your
shoulders, so go get them!

18:43.980 --> 18:46.950
You've changed, somehow.

18:49.220 --> 18:52.190
I'm happy right now,

18:52.190 --> 18:57.230
because I've finally figured out what I should do,

18:57.230 --> 18:59.720
what I can do.

19:01.000 --> 19:06.240
I'm sorry I can't be in the Joust anymore, Sagiri.

19:06.240 --> 19:09.110
No, that's okay.

19:09.110 --> 19:12.140
I'm happy as long as you're safe.

19:12.780 --> 19:14.410
Sagiri...

19:16.480 --> 19:18.450
Someone's here! Hide!

19:25.090 --> 19:27.290
Wh..What is it?

19:29.200 --> 19:30.990
What's happening?

19:31.400 --> 19:33.760
St..Stop! Let me go!

19:34.840 --> 19:36.400
Where are you taking me?!

19:36.400 --> 19:37.770
Hey, answer me!

19:37.770 --> 19:38.570
Roya...

19:38.570 --> 19:40.370
Stop it!
Roya...

20:50.080 --> 20:53.050
The winner: Noah of Neotopia!

21:00.990 --> 21:02.960
Sheesh...

21:03.990 --> 21:06.790
So, the insolent boy won?

21:15.440 --> 21:17.670
He meets all expectations.

21:17.670 --> 21:21.580
This is truly the power of a savior.

21:21.580 --> 21:23.200
Yes!

21:28.550 --> 21:30.180
Roya...

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:12.050
My old days kawarazu sawagu weekend

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Tada tanoshikute muchi de rikutsunuki de

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days matatakuma no tsukihi de

23:19.760 --> 23:24.030
Mina ano hi kara hanare sorezore mezashiteru

23:24.030 --> 23:26.700
Otona ni natte omoide wa mune te o futte

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Mukau saki o mitsume

23:27.870 --> 23:31.510
Tatakatteru sugata omotte makenai otagai mae ni

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
Soba ni inakute mo kamawanai

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
Egao mitakute mo ima ja nai

23:35.580 --> 23:37.580
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
ltsumade mo kawaranai

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

24:17.280 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
The Cost of Ambition

24:17.780 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "The Cost of Ambition"
